From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 6 Nov 2026 09:56:26 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] arcana: 0041-more-than-meets-the-eye-living-metal

More Than Meets the Eye (CR 702.162): cast a transforming DFC converted
(back face up) from hand or the command zone for its printed alternative
cost; mana value stays the front face's. New AlternativeCostType
MORE_THAN_MEETS_THE_EYE riding the disturb/modal-back plumbing, with hand
and command-zone legal-action offers.

Living metal (CR 702.161): Keyword.LIVING_METAL plus the livingMetal()
DSL helper (GrantCardType CREATURE gated by IsYourTurn).

Reflexive triggers: a "you may transform/convert ~. When you do" action
is infeasible when the transform would be ignored (CR 701.28f), impossible
(701.27b) or blocked by daybound/nightbound, so "when you do" does not
fire (CR 603.12). Ratchet, Field Medic's stacked life-gain triggers.
